{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0262_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0262_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f31cc6d1417290cfb33dce295060a76970ad22571f81695f5d769eb6a96ff27e", "ja": "（年末年始は何かと忙しくて、寝不足気味だな。\n少し仮眠を取るか。ふう……Zzz……）", "zh": "（年末年初总是忙这忙那的，感觉有点睡眠不足啊。\n要不要稍微打个盹。呼……Zzz……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0262_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0262_1001_null", "source_sha256": "ef36c413e919fdd2a7bc77d5ff1c8b17b218e90476899c1b9787481ac740ab4b", "ja": "……モフッ", "zh": "……毛茸茸的", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0262_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0262_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a33feb03ffbff262e19691c16b3149f07634a8e80e5e5ef1c44a806fc20e42fd", "ja": "……ん？\nなんだ？　あったかくて、やわらかい何かが……。", "zh": "……嗯？\n怎么回事？感觉有个暖烘烘、软绵绵的东西……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0262_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0262_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "ad5da5c8751d474f0d99948ca0edc5f56a8db81693fdb820e2b25a9d1d18eaee", "ja": "あっ……ごめん、なさい……。\n{$P$}さん、起こしちゃった……？", "zh": "啊……对不起……把{$P$}先生吵醒了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0262_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0262_1004_p", "source_sha256": "887dd6bbad47c8d802f6c3ade39682c243bdff021d6fb9c69cffa30e210375bd", "ja": "あ、ああ、お疲れさま……あ、これ、コート？\n杏奈が掛けてくれたのか。", "zh": "啊，啊啊，辛苦了……啊，这是外套？\n是杏奈帮我披上的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0262_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0262_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "58c712540a9a4fb69b144c233f8975dc6cba61a235fb393a6182835070ec4926", "ja": "うん……♪　風邪、引かないようにって……。\nそのコート、すごくもふもふで、あったかいから……。", "zh": "嗯……♪　想着别感冒了……\n因为那件外套，毛茸茸的，特别暖和……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0262_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0262_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "0a382b750afc11bd84c92c3f83678f1c8bc9f0f5600bcade904f56c09e45d69e", "ja": "杏奈の、お気に入り、です……♪\n{$P$}さん、似合う、ね……ふふ。", "zh": "是杏奈最喜欢的……♪\n{$P$}先生很适合你呢……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0262_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0262_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3492155fbe159ba028e129893857f252d659f2f3d545ae56f9c1c87c75d95fbb", "ja": "お気に入りなのに、貸してくれたんだな。\nありがとう……でも、それだと杏奈が寒くないか？", "zh": "明明是你最喜欢的东西，却还是借给我了啊。谢谢……不过这样一来，杏奈不会冷吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0262_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0262_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "deee72a9e6a88e9efe435f875d0ef861642d07b9069dacae0f9183aab10365cc", "ja": "ん……平気……。杏奈、寒いのは、\n嫌いじゃない、から……。", "zh": "嗯……没事的……。因为杏奈，\n并不讨厌，冷天……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0262_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0262_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "857d810313b6bc921510f1a2c9ee4b0092e8505b01a439ee43a52ae0dcef0e03", "ja": "コタツで、ゲームしたり……。\n楽しいこと、いっぱい、です……♪", "zh": "在被炉里玩游戏什么的……有好多开心的事……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0262_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0262_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "e16b643d14193f811cf078ff68ea2aaa0dface7dbe36456e52c7fe343ab83cc8", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、杏奈と、\nあったかくして……過ごそう、ね？　えへへ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也和杏奈一起，\n暖烘烘地……度过吧？　诶嘿嘿……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
